            "review_text": "barbamama_13\nHong Kong, China3 contributions\n3\nCHEATING! SCAM!! DO NOT GO THERE!!!\nMar 2018 • Family\nBeware if the taxi driver drove you there, we had a very BAD experience! We originally planned to go to one popular seafood restaurant, and the driver drove us there without us noticing it. The staff quickly asked us to choose seafood on arrival and at the time when I realised that we were in the wrong restaurant, they used the excuse that the food were already cooked and we had to stay there to eat. The dishes served were lukewarm and taste was terrible and disgusting. The seafood we ordered were not the same it served as it was not fresh. Very disappointing experience and strongly advise the TripAdvisor readers do NOT go there.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 31, 2018",
