            "review_title": "Review at Bai Duong Seafood",
            "review_text": "Mimi Y\nVantaa, Finland94 contributions\n1\nAvoid if possible\nDec 2017 • Family\nWe wanted to go to another seafood restaurant, but ended up in this place (Taxi driver took us). Believe some kind of deal has been made between taxi driver to \"drag\" tourists. Spent 3,210.000 VND for 5-6 dishes.\n\n1) Over priced (not 100% sure about accuracy of the weight measuring)\n\n2) Crowded, noisy, and full of guests smoking \n\n3) Over cooked almost on every dish including lobster, \"bit hard to chew\" \n\n4) Vietnamese street style of cooking, lacking of delicacy\n\nTips:\n\n1) If you would like to try Vietnamese style of seafood, recommend not ordering lobster \n\n2) Make your own mind, don't bother Taxi driver's words, go with Google map\nRead more\nWritten December 31, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
