            "review_text": "Juan Z\nPristina, Kosovo2 contributions\n0\nExcellent food friendly service.\nSep 2016 • Couples\nThe place is a popular restaurant, so do not expect any luxuries. The locale is rudimentary at best. However. The food is super fresh, cooked right out of the water. If you want to eat good seafood this is the place to go. Order simple cooking methods like steaming or grilling, to preserve the delicious seafood taste. Service was super friendly helping us with the complicated process of extracting meat from some crabs. The prices were right for such quality food. I will come back for sure.\nRead more\nWritten September 1, 2016",
